 success←CheckNetInterface;rc;loaded;msg;errMsg
 (rc loaded errMsg)←3↑2250⌶0
 :If 2 1≡rc loaded
     success←1
 :Else
     success←0
     msg←⊂'.NET Interface is not available, therefore the check for a new version cannot be carried out'
     :If 0<≢errMsg
         msg,←⊂'(',({1=≡⍵:⍵ ⋄ 1⊃,⍵}errMsg),')'
     :EndIf
     #.CursorObj←0
     {}'Launchy update check'ShowMsg2 msg
 :EndIf
